post.description:
GraphQL endpoint for IAM.

It supports queries as defined in the GraphQL Schema under Documentation.

Examples:

Single Data Source:
      ```
      {
          "query": "query {
              people(filter: {limit: 50, affiliationContains: \"student\", count: true}) {
              results {
                  iam_id name { lived_first_name lived_last_name lived_pronouns }
                  id { login_id }
                  email { primary work personal }
                  phone { primary work personal }
                  student_association { college major academic_level class_level }
                  }
              meta {
                  x_total_count
              }

              }
          }"
      }
      ```
